  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">카페에서 많은 정보를 주셔서 학생들과 함께 활동해봤어요. 학생들 반응도 좋고 이해 점검도 되는 것 같아요.<br>특히나 조별로 다른 조 평가하면서 잘못된 점 있다면 찾아서 수정하도록 하는 것도 좋은 것 같아요!<br>아래 사진 첨부해드려요. 혹시 진행하실 선생님들 참고해주세요^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f3265b5cc59ae73dfe904701d66139834ed6d3ac\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f3265b5cc59ae73dfe904701d66139834ed6d3ac\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30c49c801f2e4e390c0307c7680d27f207c169ad\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30c49c801f2e4e390c0307c7680d27f207c169ad\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79a4698cd898d1efad0e9eb9daff3400359bb810\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79a4698cd898d1efad0e9eb9daff3400359bb810\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
